"Low Power Mode saves battery by doing less in the background. Fusebox then measures this iPhone less often and stops animating." = "De energiebesparingsmodus spaart de batterij door minder op de achtergrond te doen. Fusebox meet deze iPhone dan minder vaak en animeert niet meer.";
"Low Power Mode" = "Energiebesparingsmodus";
